@baseUrl = https://fitnest-gym-feku.onrender.com
@localUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Root API Health & Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Lockers - Get All Lockers
GET {{baseUrl}}/lockers

### 3. Lockers - Search / Filter by Floor
GET {{baseUrl}}/lockers?floor=2

### 4. Lockers - Get One Locker by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/lockers/1

### 5. Lockers - Add a New Locker
POST {{baseUrl}}/lockers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Locker 501",
  "floor": 5
}

### 6. Lockers - Update Locker
PUT {{baseUrl}}/lockers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Locker 101-Renovated",
  "floor": 1
}

### 7. Twist 1 (Step 1): Soft Delete Locker 12
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lockers/12

### 8. Twist 1 (Step 2): Verify Locker 12 is Hidden (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lockers/12

### 9. Twist 1 (Step 3): Restore Locker 12
POST {{baseUrl}}/lockers/12/restore

### 10. Twist 1 (Step 4): Verify Locker 12 is Active Again (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lockers/12

### 11. Members - Get All Members
GET {{baseUrl}}/members

### 12. Members - Get One Member
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/1

### 13. Members - Add a New Member
POST {{baseUrl}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kavya Rao",
  "phone": "9988776655",
  "email": "kavya@gmail.com"
}

### 14. Members - Update Member
PUT {{baseUrl}}/members/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aarav Patel",
  "phone": "9876500000",
  "email": "aarav.new@fitnest.com"
}

### 15. Allotments - Create Allotment (Initial status: pending)
POST {{baseUrl}}/allotments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "member_id": 4,
  "locker_id": 12
}

### 16. Allotments - Prevent Double Active Allotment (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/allotments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "member_id": 5,
  "locker_id": 12
}

### 17. Allotments - Relational SQL JOIN Query (Member + Locker names)
GET {{baseUrl}}/allotments/details

### 18. Twist 2 (Step 1): Valid Status Change (pending -> approved)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/allotments/4/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved"
}

### 19. Twist 2 (Step 2): Invalid Status Change Rejected (approved -> pending)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/allotments/4/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "pending"
}

### 20. Twist 2 (Step 3): Valid Status Change (approved -> done)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/allotments/4/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "done"
}

### 21. Auth - User Registration (Module 4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "trainer_rahul",
  "password": "trainerPassword123"
}

### 22. Auth - User Login & JWT Generation (Module 4)
# @name loginRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "manikanta",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 23. Extract JWT Token
@token = {{loginRequest.response.body.token}}

### 24. Auth - Protected Route Missing Token (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile

### 25. Auth - Protected Route with Bearer Token (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 26. Auth - User Management (List Users)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/users
